 daqiqa ma’ruza","Faqat test savollarini o‘qish","Faqat uy vazifa yozdirish"],"cognitive":"qollash","construct":"PM.GEN.04","difficulty":3},{"exp":"Sinf boshqaruvida faoliyatning aniq tuzilishi muhim.","ref":"reserve-2026:T060-R5-PMGEN-Q08","stem":"Guruhli ishda shovqin va chalkashlik ko‘paydi. Eng birinchi yaxshilash qaysi?","correct":0,"options":["Vazifa, rollar, vaqt va natija mezonini aniq belgilash","Guruhli ishni har doim taqiqlash","Faqat ovozni balandlatish","Bahoni oldindan pasaytirish"],"cognitive":"qollash","construct":"PM.GEN.04","difficulty":3},{"exp":"Samarali hamkorlik o‘quvchi manfaatini va yechimni markazga qo‘yadi.","ref":"reserve-2026:T060-R5-PMGEN-Q09","stem":"Ota-ona bilan suhbatda o‘quvchi muammosi muhokama qilinadi. Qaysi yondashuv to‘g‘ri?","correct":0,"options":["Dalil, tinglash va kelishilgan keyingi qadamga tayanish","Faqat ota-onani ayblash","Boshqa o‘quvchilarning sirlarini aytish","Faqat muammo chiqqanda gaplashish"],"cognitive":"qollash","construct":"PM.GEN.05","difficulty":3},{"exp":"Nizoda faktlarni aniqlash, tomonlarni tinglash va zarur hamkorlikni tashkil qilish kerak.","ref":"reserve-2026:T060-R5-PMGEN-Q10","stem":"Sinfda ikki o‘quvchi o‘rtasida mojaro. Sinf rahbari nima qilishi kerak?","correct":0,"options":["Tomonlarni tinglab, vaziyatni aniqlab, xavfsiz va tiklovchi yechim izlash","Darhol bir tomonning gapiga ishonib jazo berish","Muammoni e’tiborsiz qoldirish","Sinf chatiga barcha tafsilotni yozish"],"cognitive":"qollash","construct":"PM.GEN.05","difficulty":3},{"exp":"Talabchanlikni hurmat va nazokat bilan uyg‘unlashtirish pedagogik taktga xos.","ref":"reserve-2026:T060-R5-PMGEN-Q11","stem":"O‘quvchi noto‘g‘ri javob berdi. O‘qituvchi uni kamsitmasdan, xatoni tahlil qilishga yo‘naltirdi. Bu qaysi sifatga yaqin?","correct":0,"options":["Pedagogik takt","Faqat akademik qobiliyat","Faqat texnik vosita","Faqat sinf hujjati"],"cognitive":"qollash","construct":"PM.GEN.06","difficulty":3},{"exp":"Nutq madaniyati tushunarlilik va auditoriyaga mos ifodani talab qiladi.","ref":"reserve-2026:T060-R5-PMGEN-Q12","stem":"O‘qituvchining nutqi juda tez va tushunarsiz. Qaysi o‘zgarish foydali?","correct":0,"options":["Nutq sur’ati, pauza va talaffuzni auditoriyaga moslashtirish","Yana ham tezroq gapirish","Faqat slaydni o‘qish","Ovoz balandligini maksimal qilish"],"cognitive":"qollash","construct":"PM.GEN.06","difficulty":3},{"exp":"Holatni sezish perseptiv, tushuntirishni moslashtirish didaktik qobiliyatga kiradi.","ref":"reserve-2026:T060-R5-PMGEN-Q13","stem":"O‘qituvchi o‘quvchining ikkilanishidan tushunmovchilikni sezib, savolni soddalashtirdi. Qaysi qobiliyatlar ko‘rindi?","correct":0,"options":["Perseptiv va didaktik qobiliyat","Faqat jismoniy qobiliyat","Faqat avtoritar ta’sir","Faqat hujjatchilik"],"cognitive":"qollash","construct":"PM.GEN.07","difficulty":3},{"exp":"Jamoa faoliyatini maqsadli uyushtirish tashkilotchilik qobiliyatiga kiradi.","ref":"reserve-2026:T060-R5-PMGEN-Q14","stem":"O‘qituvchi katta guruh faoliyatini aniq rollar va vaqt bilan uyushtirdi. Yetakchi qobiliyat qaysi?","correct":0,"options":["Tashkilotchilik qobiliyati","Faqat akademik qobiliyat","Faqat nutq qobiliyati","Faqat perseptiv qobiliyat"],"cognitive":"qollash","construct":"PM.GEN.07","difficulty":3},{"exp":"Davomli izlanish va mahsulot yaratish loyihaga asoslangan ta’limga xos.","ref":"reserve-2026:T060-R5-PMGEN-Q15","stem":"O‘quvchilar real maktab muammosiga yechim ishlab chiqib, mahsulot yaratmoqda. Qaysi texnologiya eng mos?","correct":0,"options":["Loyihaga asoslangan ta’lim","Faqat reproduktiv ko‘chirish","Faqat ma’ruza","Faqat diktant"],"cognitive":"qollash","construct":"PM.GEN.08","difficulty":3},{"exp":"Vazifa va yordamni ehtiyojga moslashtirish differensial yondashuvdir.","ref":"reserve-2026:T060-R5-PMGEN-Q16","stem":"Bir sinfda tayyorgarligi turlicha o‘quvchilar bor. O‘qituvchi vazifa murakkabligi va yordamni moslashtirdi. Qaysi yondashuv?","correct":0,"options":["Differensial ta’lim","Faqat o‘yinli ta’lim","Faqat ma’ruza","Faqat nazorat"],"cognitive":"qollash","construct":"PM.GEN.08","difficulty":3}]'::jsonb)
 loop
  if exists(select 1 from public.questions where source_reference=item->>'ref') then
   continue;
  end if;

  select c.id,c.subject_id,c.group_code
    into v_construct,v_subject,v_group
    from public.constructs c
   where c.code=item->>'construct'
     and c.is_active;

  if v_construct is null then
   raise exception 'TASK-060 R5 construct not found: %',item->>'construct';
  end if;

  select l.id into v_lesson
    from public.lesson_constructs lc
    join public.lessons l on l.id=lc.lesson_id
   where lc.construct_id=v_construct
     and l.status='published'::public.content_status
   order by case when coalesce(l.body_mdx,'')<>'' then 0 else 1 end,l.order_idx,l.id
   limit 1;

  if v_lesson is null then
   raise exception 'TASK-060 R5 source lesson not found: %',item->>'construct';
  end if;

  v_question:=gen_random_uuid();
  insert into public.questions(
    id,subject_id,construct_id,group_code,format,cognitive,difficulty,stem_md,
    assets,is_generated,status,author_id,source_reference,source_lesson_id
  ) values (
    v_question,v_subject,v_construct,v_group,
    'Y1'::public.question_format,
    (item->>'cognitive')::public.cognitive_level,
    (item->>'difficulty')::int,
    item->>'stem',
    '[]'::jsonb,
    false,
    'published'::public.content_status,
    null,
    item->>'ref',
    v_lesson
  );

  v_correct:=(item->>'correct')::int;
  for v_i in 0..3 loop
   v_option:=gen_random_uuid();
   insert into public.question_options(id,question_id,content_md,order_idx)
   values(v_option,v_question,item->'options'->>v_i,v_i);
   if v_i=v_correct then
    insert into public.question_keys(question_id,payload,explanation_md)
    values(v_question,jsonb_build_object('correct_option_id',v_option),item->>'exp');
   end if;
  end loop;
 end loop;
end
$$;

